WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.155 --> 00:00:04.580
Okay, so when Claude Code checks every link in a docs folder,

2
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:09.040
the search results land in your conversation and sit there all session.

3
00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:17.593
A Claude Code subagent is a Markdown file that runs that search in its own context window and returns only its final report.

4
00:00:17.737 --> 00:00:20.547
It starts without your conversation history,

5
00:00:20.652 --> 00:00:24.787
so the prompt in that file has to carry every rule the job needs.

6
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:27.000
The tools line is enforced,

7
00:00:27.215 --> 00:00:33.460
because a read-only subagent told to fix links got no such tool available on every Edit call.

8
00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:37.347
So I'd rely on the tools line over the prompt.
